## Interface: 11509, 16001
## Title: Warcraft Simulator
## Notes: A Warcraft III-style real-time strategy game played with WoW models: the Human Alliance, the Orcish Horde, the Undead Scourge and the Night Elf Sentinels, with the real WC3 units, buildings, tiers and upgrades. /warsim or /skirmish to play.
